      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a decent summary, but it's actually a bit too short for what my boss is looking for. The automated score is coming back pretty low because of the word count.\n\nCan you expand on this? I need it to be much more comprehensive. Try to dive deeper into the specific details of the reviews—like the specifics on the camera, the build, the software, etc.—to make it much longer and more detailed. \n\nI'm still stressing: please don't just repeat yourself or use fluff just to make it longer. I need actual substance and depth to justify the length. Just give me a much more thorough, long-form breakdown of what people are saying.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
